# Mobile app (Expo 56 + HeroUI Native)

- Routes: `apps/mobile/src/app/`; shared UI: `src/components/`
- Use `ScreenShell`, `SurfaceCard`, semantic tokens from `global.css` — see `design-system.mdc`
- Default surface only (`bg-surface`); no `surface-secondary` / `surface-tertiary`
- Package manager: Bun; navigation: Expo Router
- Do not co-locate components inside `src/app/`
